WEBVTT

Connect a project
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.834
Create a review project.

00:00:04.834 --> 00:00:08.634
Save the site address to connect it.

Share an invitation
00:00:08.634 --> 00:00:12.433
Copy the invitation link and share it with your team.

Install the bookmark
00:00:12.433 --> 00:00:17.506
Open your invitation. Press Ctrl + Shift + B to show the bookmarks bar.

00:00:17.506 --> 00:00:21.320
Drag Geomsupin onto the bookmarks bar.

00:00:21.320 --> 00:00:25.275
Open the site and click the saved bookmark.

Pin and comment
00:00:25.275 --> 00:00:29.776
Select Leave a request, then click the spot you want to review.

00:00:29.776 --> 00:00:38.619
Add your name and feedback. The screenshot is saved with your request.

Replies and status
00:00:38.619 --> 00:00:42.418
Open Requests to see the feedback and screenshot.

00:00:42.418 --> 00:00:47.529
Reply to the request and mark it Resolved.

00:00:47.529 --> 00:00:51.330
The reply and status appear on the reviewer’s page.

00:00:51.330 --> 00:00:57.331
After navigating or refreshing, click the bookmark again.
